@startuml
' --- shared skin header ---
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
' --------------------------
title State machine — Enquiry status (L2-033)

[*] --> Open : Customer sends enquiry
Open --> Replied : First caterer reply
Open --> Declined : Caterer declines\n(optional note, up to 500 characters)
Open --> Closed : Customer or caterer closes\nor System, 30 days after event date
Replied --> Closed : Customer or caterer closes\nor System, 30 days after event date
Declined --> [*]
Closed --> [*]
note right of Declined : Terminal: further changes\nand messages get HTTP 409
note right of Closed : Terminal: further changes\nand messages get HTTP 409
@enduml
